1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Hello little stompers! It's Barnaby Bear! Put on your dinosaur feet and stomp with me!

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Are you ready to roar? Let's go!

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Big green footprints in the sand, Dinosaur dancing across the land!

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Stomp your two feet, one and two, Here comes a happy dino dance for you!

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Stomp, stomp, dinosaur, stomp on the floor! Give a little wiggle and a happy roar!

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Swish your big tail, tap your tiny claws, Dinosaur dancing gives a loud applause!

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Flap little pterodactyl wings so high, Flying past the clouds in the sunny sky!

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Spin all around like a dino spinning top, Dancing to the beat that will never stop!

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Stomp, stomp, dinosaur, stomp on the floor! Give a little wiggle and a happy roar!

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Swish your big tail, tap your tiny claws, Dinosaur dancing gives a loud applause!

11
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Whew! That was such a mighty dinosaur stomp! Barnaby Bear had so much fun with you!

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,000
See you next time, little dinos! Roar and bye-bye!
